1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Stress can make even a small decision feel heavy.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,180
Yet many well-being apps ask for more attention.

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:09,080
Create an account, complete a questionnaire,

4
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:12,480
search a large library, or protect a streak.

5
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,320
We built Softer around the opposite idea.

6
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:19,120
Reduce the pressure and offer one useful next action.

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,920
Softer is a private native Mac app

8
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,160
for ordinary stressful moments.

9
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,880
A person can begin without an account, an alias,

10
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,720
or saved history.

11
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,160
The name is also the design rule.

12
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:34,000
Every path should be easy to understand,

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,360
easy to leave, and fully under the person's control.

14
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,480
Instead of diagnosing a mood,

15
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,880
Softer asks what might feel useful right now.

16
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:47,080
The person chooses a plain-language need.

17
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:50,160
The app never reads sensors, typing, gameplay,

18
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,200
or time on screen.

19
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,800
It suggests one starting point, explains why,

20
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:58,160
and keeps other choices visible.

21
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,260
Gentle Breathing is an adjustable visual

22
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:02,760
pacer, not a command.

23
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:05,160
The pace can be changed, paused, or watched

24
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:07,320
with shape-only wording.

25
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:12,000
Reduce Motion replaces the animation with a static cue.

26
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,520
Stop remains available if the exercise does not feel right.

27
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,800
For someone who wants active focus,

28
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:22,000
Harbor Tiles is a short spatial puzzle.

29
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,560
Answers stay hidden.

30
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:26,800
Each cove supports multiple valid routes,

31
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:30,200
and a hint appears only when requested.

32
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:33,360
Undo lets the person reconsider without penalty.

33
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:37,000
Harbor Path offers a quieter waypoint activity.

34
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,160
Both experiences are finite and scoreless.

35
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:44,400
There is no timer, streak, losing, leaderboard,

36
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:47,000
or endless reward loop.

37
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,320
Stopping or skipping is still a valid ending.

38
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:53,440
After an activity, a short optional checkout

39
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:56,960
asks whether the person feels more settled, the same,

40
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:59,840
less settled, or chose to skip.

41
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:02,920
Only that explicit response can slightly reorder

42
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:05,720
future suggestions on this Mac.

43
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,960
If an activity feels less helpful,

44
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:12,640
Softer temporarily cools it down instead of pushing repetition.

45
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:16,000
Free text, game performance, time spent,

46
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:19,440
and support actions are never used.

47
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:24,040
Human support is kept separate from personalization.

48
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:25,880
The Need Help Now route

49
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,600
remains available even when

50
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:30,120
the encrypted workspace is locked.

51
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:33,200
Softer labels United States crisis options,

52
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,560
links to an international directory,

53
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:38,040
and provides clear routes to a trusted person

54
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,600
or professional care.

55
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:43,720
It cannot detect a crisis, contact anyone automatically,

56
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:46,360
or replace emergency services.

57
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,720
We built Softer with SwiftUI, CryptoKit,

58
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:52,840
and the macOS keychain.

59
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:56,400
There's no AI model, chatbot, advertising,

60
00:02:56,400 --> 00:03:00,800
analytics service, account system, or cloud backend.

61
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:03,760
Fifty-eight behavioral checks cover the activities,

62
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:06,360
games, recommendation boundaries,

63
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:10,280
support isolation, and encrypted storage.

64
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:14,920
Those checks verify the software, not a mental-health outcome.

65
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:18,680
Softer does not diagnose, treat, or promise calm.

66
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,200
It makes the next minute smaller

67
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:25,040
by keeping every choice clear, private, and optional.

